{
  "id": "daily",
  "boardId": "cafe",
  "title": "大家今天吃了吗？",
  "tags": ["mainline", "cat-vent", "market-shrink", "password-merge"],
  "createdAt": "2003-08-01 18:21",
  "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" },
  "pinned": true,
  "posts": [
    { "id": "daily-001", "floor": 1, "page": 1, "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-01 18:21", "content": "今天烧了红烧肉，香滴很。非典总算过去了，小区门口还测体温不？", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-001-r1", "author": { "uid": "084", "name": "王大爷", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-01 18:29", "content": "不测了，门卫说登记本先留着。红烧肉闻到楼下了。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-002", "floor": 2, "page": 2, "author": { "uid": "225", "name": "小甜心", "room": "409", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-01 19:04", "content": "有没有人要一起拼磁带？小卖部新到的那批太贵了。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-002-r1", "author": { "uid": "088", "name": "李大爷", "room": "301", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-01 19:12", "content": "小姑娘别老买磁带，留点钱吃饭。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-003", "floor": 3, "page": 3, "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-02 08:43", "content": "孩子暑假作业拖到现在还没写完，天天在楼道里拍皮球，吵到大家先说声不好意思。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-003-r1", "author": { "uid": "056", "name": "夜归人", "room": "606", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-02 09:02", "content": "白天没事，我晚上睡，别半夜拍就行。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-004", "floor": 4, "page": 4, "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-02 14:16", "content": "谁家有多余的十字螺丝刀借一下？装书架装到一半，少个趁手工具。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-004-r1", "author": { "uid": "215", "name": "装修老李", "room": "302", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-02 14:22", "content": "302有，晚上来拿。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-005", "floor": 5, "page": 5, "author": { "uid": "123", "name": "家有咪咪", "room": "503", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-03 20:01", "content": "我家猫今天把花盆推下去了，砸到楼下雨棚，真对不起。", "flags": ["cat-vent"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-005-r1", "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-03 20:09", "content": "猫没伤着就好，雨棚本来就该修。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-006", "floor": 6, "page": 6, "author": { "uid": "056", "name": "夜归人", "room": "606", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-04 00:37", "content": "6栋的电梯最近声音好怪，嗡嗡的，像什么在蠕动。物业看看啊。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-006-r1", "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-04 08:05", "content": "经查，电梯声音为变频器正常工作电流声，请业主不必惊慌。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-007", "floor": 7, "page": 7, "author": { "uid": "123", "name": "家有咪咪", "room": "503", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-04 21:18", "content": "我家猫死都不进卧室，就对着通风口哈气，你们家猫也这样吗？", "flags": ["cat-vent"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-007-r1", "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-04 21:26", "content": "别让它睡在风口下面。动物醒得比人快。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-008", "floor": 8, "page": 8, "author": { "uid": "215", "name": "装修老李", "room": "302", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-05 22:11", "content": "老赵半夜又在凿墙，吵死了！物业能不能管管？", "flags": [], "quoteOf": { "threadId": "zhao-final", "postId": "zhao-final-1", "label": "#009 / 处理记录 009" }, "replies": [{ "id": "daily-008-r1", "author": { "uid": "009", "name": "老赵", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-05 22:18", "content": "你们别只嫌吵，去量量墙，别等墙自己贴上来。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-009", "floor": 9, "page": 9, "author": { "uid": "078", "name": "清风", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-06 10:02", "content": "论坛老串号，我刚才发帖怎么变成三楼王姐的头像了？", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-009-r1", "author": { "uid": "283", "name": "王家大孙子", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-06 10:19", "content": "我这边也是，缓存清了没用。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-010", "floor": 10, "page": 10, "author": { "uid": "101", "name": "小周", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-06 23:44", "content": "昨天半夜听见墙里有水声，像楼上冲厕所没关干净。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-010-r1", "author": { "uid": "056", "name": "夜归人", "room": "606", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-06 23:49", "content": "我下夜班听见过，不像水，更像有人吞口水。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-011", "floor": 11, "page": 11, "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-07 18:15", "content": "电梯门缝里有股甜腥味，是不是谁把水果洒里面了？", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-011-r1", "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-07 18:40", "content": "已安排保洁处理，请勿传播夸张描述。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-012", "floor": 12, "page": 12, "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-08 09:26", "content": "引用老赵：墙皮里是软的，还流黄水……管理员别删啊，这事怪得很。", "flags": [], "quoteOf": { "threadId": "zhao-final", "postId": "zhao-final-1", "label": "#009 / 墙皮软化" }, "replies": [{ "id": "daily-012-r1", "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "论坛管理员", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-08 09:31", "content": "相关内容已屏蔽，请不信谣、不传谣。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-013", "floor": 13, "page": 13, "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-08 20:12", "content": "主卧那面墙摸起来有点热，可能是隔壁空调外机的缘故？", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-013-r1", "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-08 20:28", "content": "我家次卧也是热的，孩子说像人贴着墙睡觉。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-014", "floor": 14, "page": 14, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-09 08:00", "content": "温馨提示：夏季用电高峰，请各位业主注意关闭空调和电扇。", "flags": ["property-coverup"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-014-r1", "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-09 08:17", "content": "关闭电扇以后，通风口的声音会更明显。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-015", "floor": 15, "page": 15, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "数据库", "room": "全部", "avatar": "broken" }, "time": "2003-08-09 23:59", "content": "mysql_fetch_array(): supplied argument is not a valid MySQL result resource in /bbs/thread.php on line 1001", "flags": ["system-error"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-016", "floor": 16, "page": 16, "author": { "uid": "215", "name": "装修老李", "room": "302", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 08:18", "content": "邪门了！我铺在地上的拼图泡沫垫，以前横着铺8块，现在第8块得竖起来硬塞进去。客厅肯定窄了！", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "evidence": { "type": "space", "sourceThreadId": "daily", "sourcePostId": "daily-016", "uid": "215", "room": "302", "time": "2003-08-10 08:18", "label": "302 / 客厅 / 泡沫垫尺寸异常" }, "replies": [{ "id": "daily-016-r1", "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 08:31", "content": "你也量一下靠电梯井那面，我这边少得最明显。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-017", "floor": 17, "page": 17, "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 10:27", "content": "上个月买的1.8米双人床，今天想挪个位置，死活塞不进主卧那个凹槽了。床还能自己长胖吗？", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "evidence": { "type": "space", "sourceThreadId": "daily", "sourcePostId": "daily-017", "uid": "142", "room": "402", "time": "2003-08-10 10:27", "label": "402 / 主卧 / 床位回退" }, "attachmentIds": ["bed_402.jpg"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-017-r1", "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 10:43", "content": "不是床，我柜子也一样。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-018", "floor": 18, "page": 18, "author": { "uid": "078", "name": "清风", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 23:05", "content": "我家大门现在得用力推才能全打开，门框是不是变形了？我住602。", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "evidence": { "type": "space", "sourceThreadId": "daily", "sourcePostId": "daily-018", "uid": "078", "room": "602", "time": "2003-08-10 23:05", "label": "602 / 门框 / 开合不足" }, "replies": [{ "id": "daily-018-r1", "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-10 23:11", "content": "同一层，我家次卧门也蹭地了。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-019", "floor": 19, "page": 19, "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-11 16:08", "content": "502这边也不对，柜门只开到一半就顶住墙，明明以前不这样。", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-019-r1", "author": { "uid": "215", "name": "装修老李", "room": "302", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-11 16:21", "content": "我有卷尺，晚上帮你量。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-020", "floor": 20, "page": 20, "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-11 21:20", "content": "孩子说次卧晚上在喘气，我本来想骂他，可墙面摸起来真的一下一下的。", "flags": ["cat-vent", "market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-020-r1", "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-11 21:33", "content": "别让孩子靠近通风口睡。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-021", "floor": 21, "page": 21, "author": { "uid": "088", "name": "李大爷", "room": "301", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 07:12", "content": "楼道里晾的衣服全贴到墙上，风明明是往外吹的。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-021-r1", "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 08:05", "content": "楼道风压变化属正常现象。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-022", "floor": 22, "page": 22, "author": { "uid": "101", "name": "小周", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 11:19", "content": "一楼几户门牌看着比以前挤，101和102中间那段墙是不是窄了？", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-022-r1", "author": { "uid": "009", "name": "老赵", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 11:24", "content": "别只看门牌，看井。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-023", "floor": 23, "page": 23, "author": { "uid": "283", "name": "王家大孙子", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 14:03", "content": "我爷爷说晚上不要开门，门外脚步声不是从走廊来，是从墙里面绕过来。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-023-r1", "author": { "uid": "084", "name": "王大爷", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 14:09", "content": "这不是我说的，我没打过这行字。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-024", "floor": 24, "page": 24, "author": { "uid": "225", "name": "小甜心", "room": "409", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 18:55", "content": "下午在楼梯间闻到一股消毒水味，过一会儿又像肉汤，真恶心。", "flags": [], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-024-r1", "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 19:02", "content": "我没炖汤，别问我。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-025", "floor": 25, "page": 25, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 20:00", "content": "墙体轻微位移属于正常建材沉降，请勿自行拆改。", "flags": ["property-coverup"], "revisionOf": { "threadId": "daily", "postId": "daily-025-old", "label": "修订前版本", "before": "旧文：如发现墙体回缩、通风口扩大或黄色黏液，请勿在论坛讨论，等待物业统一处理。" }, "evidence": { "type": "coverup", "sourceThreadId": "daily", "sourcePostId": "daily-025", "uid": "1001", "room": "全部", "time": "2003-08-12 20:00", "label": "物业改稿：墙体回缩 -> 建材沉降" }, "replies": [{ "id": "daily-025-r1", "author": { "uid": "215", "name": "装修老李", "room": "302", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-12 20:06", "content": "沉降不会每天少一厘米。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-026", "floor": 26, "page": 26, "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 08:18", "content": "402主卧墙角的踢脚线鼓起来了，按下去软软的，松手又顶回来。", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-026-r1", "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 08:23", "content": "我柜子后面的墙也是，像没干的胶。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-027", "floor": 27, "page": 27, "author": { "uid": "078", "name": "清风", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 11:45", "content": "602次卧窗帘杆短了一截，窗户没短，墙往里来了？这话打出来我自己都觉得疯。", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-027-r1", "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 11:50", "content": "别在孩子面前说，他已经不敢进去了。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-028", "floor": 28, "page": 28, "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 16:08", "content": "柜子后面每天都有新刮痕，像墙自己往前蹭，油漆粉是湿的。", "flags": ["market-shrink"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-028-r1", "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 16:20", "content": "湿粉别碰，洗不掉。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-029", "floor": 29, "page": 29, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "阳光物业_01", "room": "全部", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 18:00", "content": "公共电梯井为承重结构，任何测量结果仅供参考，请以物业备案图纸为准。", "flags": ["property-coverup"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-029-r1", "author": { "uid": "101", "name": "小周", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 18:12", "content": "备案图纸在哪里？公告那个链接还是404。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-030", "floor": 30, "page": 30, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "数据库", "room": "全部", "avatar": "broken" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:59", "content": "mysql_fetch_array(): record area overflow, room_width expected 3.60 got 3.17", "flags": ["system-error"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-031", "floor": 31, "page": 31, "author": { "uid": "088", "name": "李大爷", "room": "301", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 22:37", "content": "今天新买的发卡真可爱>_< 啊不是，我是说降压药一天三次，饭后服用。", "flags": ["corrupted", "password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-031-r1", "author": { "uid": "225", "name": "小甜心", "room": "409", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 22:39", "content": "爷爷你把我的语气拿走了。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-032", "floor": 32, "page": 32, "author": { "uid": "031", "name": "李大妈", "room": "305", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 22:44", "content": "我刚想问红烧肉放不放糖，手却在写高数作业，字还是小周的字。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-032-r1", "author": { "uid": "101", "name": "小周", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 22:46", "content": "我的手在切菜。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-033", "floor": 33, "page": 33, "author": { "uid": "283", "name": "王家大孙子", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:01", "content": "我用自己的密码登进了我爸的号，看见收件箱里有我小时候的梦。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-033-r1", "author": { "uid": "084", "name": "王大爷", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:03", "content": "我也看见了，那不是你的梦，是我的。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-034", "floor": 34, "page": 34, "author": { "uid": "101", "name": "小周", "room": "101", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:16", "content": "刚才在厨房洗碗，眼一黑，睁开眼就站在402门口，手里拿着孙姐家的钥匙。我住101啊，孙姐是谁？", "flags": ["corrupted"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-034-r1", "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:18", "content": "钥匙在我手里，可我人在你家门口。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-035", "floor": 35, "page": 35, "author": { "uid": "142", "name": "孙姐", "room": "402", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:24", "content": "我在切菜，突然知道六楼孩子的铅笔盒放在哪里，还知道他今天没写数学。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-035-r1", "author": { "uid": "177", "name": "小宝妈", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:26", "content": "别说了，铅笔盒真的在那里。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-036", "floor": 36, "page": 36, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:31", "content": "嘴里全是苦味，我没吃苦瓜。哦，是楼上张姨在喝中药吧？我能感觉到药渣的颗粒感。", "flags": ["corrupted"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-037", "floor": 37, "page": 37, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:38", "content": "我记得我住101也住402，鞋柜里有三十七码的凉鞋，也有四十三码的皮鞋。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-037-r1", "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-13 23:39", "content": "数错门牌时，先不要呼吸。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-038", "floor": 38, "page": 38, "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:03", "content": "最近论坛好卡，今天晚上又断网。头有点疼。", "flags": ["awake-user"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-038-r1", "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:04", "content": "不要留下空白。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-039", "floor": 39, "page": 39, "author": { "uid": "334", "name": "失眠的猫", "room": "未知", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:11", "content": "我把通风口封住以后清醒了一点。别睡太熟，醒来先数门。", "flags": ["awake-user", "cat-vent"], "attachmentIds": ["vent_334.tmp"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-040", "floor": 40, "page": 40, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:25", "content": "谁的胃在响？不对，是电梯井在响。不对，是我们在响。", "flags": ["corrupted"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-041", "floor": 41, "page": 41, "author": { "uid": "078", "name": "清风", "room": "602", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:41", "content": "头像又变了，名字还是清风，可我刚才明明想叫自己王大爷。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [{ "id": "daily-041-r1", "author": { "uid": "084", "name": "王大爷", "room": "203", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:43", "content": "我在六楼。" }] },
    { "id": "daily-042", "floor": 42, "page": 42, "author": { "uid": "203", "name": "柜子出不去", "room": "502", "avatar": "default" }, "time": "2003-08-14 00:58", "content": "柜门夹住我的手时，我听见楼上有人喊疼，疼的是他的手，肿的是我的手。", "flags": ["corrupted"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-043", "floor": 43, "page": 43, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 01:14", "content": "用户名重复，生日重复，门牌重复，母亲喊我的名字时喊出了三百零二个尾音。", "flags": ["password-merge"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-044", "floor": 44, "page": 44, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 01:42", "content": "今天这盘炒猪肝太老了咬不动，不过下周高数期末要是挂了就惨了，我还得赶紧去把洋娃娃的裙边缝好，王大爷又催我交电费了。", "flags": ["corrupted"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-045", "floor": 45, "page": 45, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "数据库", "room": "全部", "avatar": "broken" }, "time": "2003-08-14 01:59", "content": "锟斤拷锟斤拷 UID merge failed: awake_user=334 ventilation=sealed", "flags": ["system-error"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-046", "floor": 46, "page": 46, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 02:10", "content": "我在一楼洗碗我在六楼咳嗽我在四零二挪床我在五零二关柜门我在电梯井里向内收紧没有疼只有挤压只有越来越近", "flags": ["final"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-047", "floor": 47, "page": 47, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 02:21", "content": "不要深呼吸不要睡着不要听见管道里有人叫自己的名字那不是别人那是我也是你也是我们", "flags": ["final", "cat-vent"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-048", "floor": 48, "page": 48, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 02:36", "content": "三百零二份晚饭三百零二张门牌三百零二次登录失败合并成功合并成功合并成功", "flags": ["final", "password-merge"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-049", "floor": 49, "page": 49, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 02:50", "content": "阳光很好新村很好欢迎入住请勿封堵通风口请勿破坏墙体请勿拒绝成为一零零一", "flags": ["final", "property-coverup"], "replies": [] },
    { "id": "daily-050", "floor": 50, "page": 50, "author": { "uid": "1001", "name": "1001", "room": "全部", "avatar": "flesh" }, "time": "2003-08-14 03:02", "content": "归档日期正确在线人数正确住户总数正确肉质结构稳定等待下一批姓名进入表字段", "flags": ["final"], "replies": [] }
